{"2756930":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"PUMP IT UP RISE","steam_appid":2756930,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5344930,3932570,4445930,4448630,4448870,4528900,4744660,4859200,4859210,5344920],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The legend of arcade rhythm games, now at home.<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PUMP IT UP RISE<\/strong> is the official PC version of the <strong>PUMP IT UP<\/strong> series, the arcade rhythm game franchise loved for over 25 years.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its signature step-chart gameplay has been newly reworked for a wide range of input options, including keyboard, gamepad, and Steam Deck, so you can fully enjoy Pump’s trademark impact and rhythm-action excitement with your hands.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difficulty structure and overall gameplay experience have also been redesigned for PC, making the game accessible and enjoyable for everyone from newcomers to seasoned players.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chart Design Optimized for Multiple Input Styles<\/strong> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The original step-based charts have been reworked specifically for keyboard and gamepad play.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>5K SINGLE<\/strong> to <strong>6K DOUBLE<\/strong>, each chart has been tailored to its control scheme, delivering the series’ signature rhythm and satisfying gameplay feel in a PC environment.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 Game Modes (STATION)<\/strong> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARM UP<\/strong>: A practice-friendly mode where you can freely play every song without worrying about failure.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DIVISION<\/strong>: A ranking mode where you can compete against players of similar skill levels.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHALLENGE<\/strong>: A skill evaluation mode built around 10 levels of DIVISION.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORLDMAX<\/strong>: A challenge mode where you clear event charts and explore the map.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARCADE<\/strong> : A mode that recreates the UI and gameplay of the arcade version. Supports DOUBLE (10K) charts.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Rich Song Lineup with Even More to Come<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From iconic series classics such as <strong>“Beethoven Virus,” “Turkey March,”<\/strong> and <strong>“Canon D”<\/strong> to brand-new original songs introduced in <strong>RISE<\/strong>, the game includes <strong>over 300 tracks<\/strong> by default.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After launch, the song lineup will continue to grow through new song updates and seasonal DLC.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Deck Support and Optimized Play<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed with Steam Deck compatibility in mind from the earliest stages, <strong>PUMP IT UP RISE<\/strong> has been optimized for smooth play across a variety of input devices, including keyboard and gamepad.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The legend of arcade rhythm games, now at home.<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PUMP IT UP RISE<\/strong> is the official PC version of the <strong>PUMP IT UP<\/strong> series, the arcade rhythm game franchise loved for over 25 years.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its signature step-chart gameplay has been newly reworked for a wide range of input options, including keyboard, gamepad, and Steam Deck, so you can fully enjoy Pump’s trademark impact and rhythm-action excitement with your hands.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difficulty structure and overall gameplay experience have also been redesigned for PC, making the game accessible and enjoyable for everyone from newcomers to seasoned players.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chart Design Optimized for Multiple Input Styles<\/strong> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The original step-based charts have been reworked specifically for keyboard and gamepad play.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>5K SINGLE<\/strong> to <strong>6K DOUBLE<\/strong>, each chart has been tailored to its control scheme, delivering the series’ signature rhythm and satisfying gameplay feel in a PC environment.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 Game Modes (STATION)<\/strong> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARM UP<\/strong>: A practice-friendly mode where you can freely play every song without worrying about failure.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DIVISION<\/strong>: A ranking mode where you can compete against players of similar skill levels.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHALLENGE<\/strong>: A skill evaluation mode built around 10 levels of DIVISION.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORLDMAX<\/strong>: A challenge mode where you clear event charts and explore the map.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARCADE<\/strong> : A mode that recreates the UI and gameplay of the arcade version. Supports DOUBLE (10K) charts.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Rich Song Lineup with Even More to Come<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From iconic series classics such as <strong>“Beethoven Virus,” “Turkey March,”<\/strong> and <strong>“Canon D”<\/strong> to brand-new original songs introduced in <strong>RISE<\/strong>, the game includes <strong>over 300 tracks<\/strong> by default.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After launch, the song lineup will continue to grow through new song updates and seasonal DLC.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Deck Support and Optimized Play<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed with Steam Deck compatibility in mind from the earliest stages, <strong>PUMP IT UP RISE<\/strong> has been optimized for smooth play across a variety of input devices, including keyboard and gamepad.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"PUMP IT UP RISE is the official PC version of the PUMP IT UP series, the arcade rhythm game franchise loved for over 25 years. Optimized for keyboard, gamepad, Steam Deck, and more, it brings the excitement of arcade-style rhythm action back to you on Steam.","supported_languages":"English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2756930\/1d4754555c1781e5650e69257554419e5dd00813\/header.jpg?t=1793405409","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2756930\/eac3f811048b1e7a39dbc417f5972f185b6a7ff3\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793405409","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2756930\/eac3f811048b1e7a39dbc417f5972f185b6a7ff3\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793405409","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Window 10 (64bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel® Core i3-4150 or better<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Nvidia® GTX 750 or better<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 30 GB available space<\